<title>SOUTH AFRICA: MGX boosts year earnings, upbeat on 1997.</title>
<headline>MGX boosts year earnings, upbeat on 1997.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     34.4	  vs 30.6</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   36.2	  vs 25.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   9.70	  vs 7.83</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   14.58	 vs 11.35</p>
<p>    Tax			 5.28	  vs 3.53</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.73	  vs 0.14</p>
<p>    Abnormal cost	   0.50	  vs 1.39 gain</p>
<p>    Turnover		  78.68	 vs 45.03</p>
<p>Full name: MGX Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The information management group said it would announce a dividend with results for the period ending June 30.</p>
<p>In the coming year, revenues are expected to exceed 110 million rand and profit growth should maintain the present trend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
